title CBUAE F1

note across #AAA: digital currencies CorDapp participant Nodes (VNode X500 identities)
group My own label
note across #AAA: digital currencies CorDapp participant Nodes (VNode X500 identities)

    TOK_DEF_AUTH -> TOK_DEF_AUTH:
end

TOK_DEF_AUTH -> TOK_DEF_AUTH: <b>CreateTokenDefinitionRequest</b>\n (Author, \n issuer.x500Name, \n metadata = mapOf("symbol" to "GBP"), \n issuanceMode = "MINT_ON_DEMAND", notary?, observers[])

TOK_DEF_AUTH -> NOTARY++: probably not (not consuming states)
NOTARY --> TOK_DEF_AUTH--: return 
TOK_DEF_AUTH -> LFI: observer(ResponderFlow Init)
LFI -> TOK_DEF_AUTH: ResponderFlow END

TOK_DEF_AUTH -> LFI2: [multiple]observer(ResponderFlow Init)
LFI2 -> TOK_DEF_AUTH: ResponderFlow END





TOK_DEF_AUTH -> LFI: Sync token definition

TOK_ISS_ENT -> LFI: issue token

LFI -> LFI2: transfer token


@enduml